# Copy this into Vercel: Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables
# (Production), then REDEPLOY -- variables only apply to deployments made
# after they were saved. Without it, submitting the Dealer or Contact form
# shows a "please call or email us" message instead of pretending to submit.
#
# To try it locally, put the same line in .env.local (git-ignored), run
# `npm run dev` and submit the Contact form.
# Full walkthrough: README.md -> "Form delivery".

# Web3Forms access key (https://web3forms.com) -- public by design: the
# Dealer and Contact forms submit straight to Web3Forms from the browser, so
# this ships in the client bundle. Must be NEXT_PUBLIC_ to be readable there.
# Restrict it to this site's domain from the Web3Forms dashboard to stop it
# being reused elsewhere.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
